      reg: { pra: 'Accurate accounts and regulatory returns depend on controlled journals (PRA Fundamental Rules 6 and 7; the SM&CR responsibility for the integrity of financial information). Recurring corrective journals often point to technology faults that should be fixed at source.', also: 'Companies Act 2006 s386 (adequate accounting records); external audit journal testing.' },
