      reg: { pra: 'Controlled change is central to the systems and controls expected under PRA Fundamental Rules 5 and 6 - the TSB enforcement (2022) concerned failures in governing technology change. Changes that alter reported figures also engage Fundamental Rule 7.', also: 'External audit IT general controls over change management; PRA SS2/21 for changes delivered by suppliers.' },
